<title>JAPAN: Teikoku Piston - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Teikoku Piston - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 15.20		vs	   15.12</p>
<p> Operating	  285    million	  vs	  269    million</p>
